problem X? + Y? = Z? + Z?
answers
  0: X? := ∅, Y? := ∅, Z? := ∅
  1: X? := U1! + U1!, Y? := ∅, Z? := U1!
  2: X? := U1!, Y? := U1!, Z? := U1!
  3: X? := U1! + U2! + U2!, Y? := U1!, Z? := U1! + U2!
  4: X? := ∅, Y? := U1! + U1!, Z? := U1!
  5: X? := U1! + U1!, Y? := U2! + U2!, Z? := U1! + U2!
  6: X? := U1!, Y? := U1! + U2! + U2!, Z? := U1! + U2!
  7: X? := U1! + U1! + U2!, Y? := U2! + U3! + U3!, Z? := U1! + U2! + U3!
derivation
  ⊢ - | X? + Y? = Z? + Z? | -
  solve X? + Y? = Z? + Z?
    vars X? Y? Z? | aliens - | L (1,1,0) R (0,0,2) La () Ra ()
    compatible - | P - | B [(2,0,1) (1,1,1) (0,2,1)]
    branch []: X? := Z1 + Z1 + Z2, Y? := Z2 + Z3 + Z3, Z? := Z1 + Z2 + Z3
      ⊢ X? := Z1 + Z1 + Z2, Y? := Z2 + Z3 + Z3, Z? := Z1 + Z2 + Z3 | - | -
      cover answer 7 with U1! := Z1, U2! := Z2, U3! := Z3
